# Environment variables these skills read. Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill
# in, or export directly in the shell/session that runs Claude Science.
#
# Neither variable has a built-in default as of this fix: both DepMap-file
# skills raise FileNotFoundError naming the variable when it is unset, rather
# than silently trying a path from the machine they were developed on. See
# README.md "Running these on another Claude Science account" for what each
# points at and why it can't be scripted (depmap.org and the trained GeneTEA
# model are both manual downloads).

# Directory holding the local DepMap release: CRISPRGeneEffect.csv, Model.csv,
# CRISPRGeneDependency.csv, and the other files depmap-local/README.md lists.
# Required by: depmap-local, depmap-genetea.
DEPMAP_ROOT=

# Path to a trained GeneTEA.pkl (1.11 GB). Required by: depmap-genetea only.
# Source: https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.28635317, file 53289398.
GENETEA_MODEL=
